  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">RBM st&#xf6;d till Georgian Foundation for Strategic and International Studies</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RBM support to Georgian Foundation for Strategic  and International Studies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida ger k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till Georgian Foundation for Strategic and International Studies (nedan kallat GFSIS). St&#xf6;det omfattar perioden 1 januari 2022 till 31 december 2024 och en total budget om 22 000 000 SEK. Som en del av beredningen identifierades behov att bidra ytterligare till organisationens institutionella h&#xe5;llbarhet, genom att st&#xf6;dja organisationens utveckling av en strategisk plan och en resursmobiliseringsplan, inklusive utveckla programmets interventionslogik och resultatramverk, genom att avropa expertst&#xf6;d fr&#xe5;n Sidas ramavtal f&#xf6;r resultatstyrning.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida give core support to the Georgian Foundation for Strategic and International Studies (hereinafter referred to as GFSIS). The support covers the period 1 January 2022 to 31 December 2024 and a total budget of SEK 22,000,000. As part of the appraisal, a need was identified to further contribute to the organization&apos;s institutional sustainability, by supporting the organization&apos;s development of a strategic plan and a resource mobilization plan, including developing the program&apos;s intervention logic and results framework, by calling of expert support from Sida&apos;s framework agreement for results-based management.</narrative>
  </description>
